# Dependencies of the independent mdoc verification harness. Go ignores
# testdata/ when building, so these only affect repo size.
internal/mdl/testdata/verify/node_modules/

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored: the harness is the executable
# contract shared with cdpi-wallet and the reader app, and "verifies against
# @owf/mdoc" only means something if it is the same @owf/mdoc everywhere. A
# floating ^0.7.0 could pull a minor that changes verification behaviour and
# turn a real interop failure into a silent pass — or the reverse.
